# Canonical AdBlock source manifest
# Format: SOURCE|POLICY|KIND(optional)|CATEGORY(optional)
# POLICY: REJECT, REJECT-DROP, REJECT-NO-DROP, DIRECT
# KIND: auto (default), domainset
# CATEGORY: Local, Advertising, Privacy, Security, AntiAD,
#           ThreatIntel_Ultimate, ThreatIntel_TIF, ThreatIntel, Other
#
# Rules:
#   - Only .list / .txt / domainset URLs, or .sgmodule files that contain a [Rule] section
#   - Script / URL Rewrite modules: rulesets/Sources/Links/AdBlock_functional_sources.list → PROMAX
#   - PROMAX references rulesets/AdBlock/*.list via RULE-SET + merged functional sections
#
# Example:
#   https://example.com/list.txt|REJECT|auto|Advertising
#   https://example.com/domainset.txt|REJECT|domainset|Advertising

# blackmatrix7 - broad ad/privacy coverage
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script@master/rule/Surge/Advertising/Advertising_All.list|REJECT|auto|Advertising
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script@master/rule/Surge/Privacy/Privacy_All.list|REJECT|auto|Privacy
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script@master/rule/Surge/Hijacking/Hijacking.list|REJECT|auto|Security

