# Excluded as category pollution or high breakage risk:
# - geekdada/social-media-filter: social sharing widgets, not advertising
# - wdmpa/content-farm-list: search-result content farms, not advertising
# - blackmatrix7/AdobeActivation: activation/licensing, not advertising
# - blackmatrix7/JiGuangTuiSong: push notification delivery, blocking may break notifications
# - blackmatrix7/Privacy_All_No_Resolve: semantic duplicate of Privacy_All

